--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
REASONING TRACE
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

  1. MODULARITY: Decoupling the LLM connection logic from the Agent 
     instructions allows us to swap models (e.g., Gemini 2.0 Flash to 
     Gemini 1.5 Pro) without touching the agent logic.
     
  2. READABILITY: As the number of agents and their instructions grow, 
     keeping them in a dedicated 'agent_definitions.py' file prevents 
     the main entry point from becoming cluttered.

